            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Psychic &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Thought-Spines</p><p><em>Violet spines across the crown, and other people's dreams start including you.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Telepathy 30 feet</strong> with willing creatures with whom you share a language.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Your Strikes may deal <strong>mental</strong>; <strong>+1d4 mental</strong>.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><strong>+1d6 mental.</strong> On a critical hit the target is <strong>stupefied 1</strong> until the end of its next turn.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><strong>+1d6 mental.</strong> Once per round, a creature you damage must succeed at a Will save against your class DC or be <strong>confused</strong> until the end of its next turn.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
